{"noun":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/11/7b/84_crt_xc45y.jpg?r=1587737580","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/11/7b/84_crt_xc45y.jpg?r=1587737580","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/11/7b/84_crt_xc45y.jpg?r=1587737580","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/11/7b/84_crt_xc45y.jpg?r=1587737580"},"name":"草薙素子","summary":"自卫军出身,军衔三佐.\r\n极其擅长电子战,作战经验丰富,领导能力优秀.\r\n幼年6岁时,遭遇空难,除脑和脊髓部分全身义体化.\r\n外部记忆装置,义体大小调整前所佩带女式手表","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/d4/88/3877_prsn_VOY27.jpg?r=1574050572","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/d4/88/3877_prsn_VOY27.jpg?r=1574050572","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/d4/88/3877_prsn_VOY27.jpg?r=1574050572","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/d4/88/3877_prsn_VOY27.jpg?r=1574050572"},"name":"坂本真綾","short_summary":"坂本真绫（さかもと まあや、1980年3月31日 - ），日本女声优、歌手、演员、电台主持。东京都板桥区出身，东京都立武蔵丘高等学校及东洋大学社会学部毕业，父亲是舞台照明家坂本义美。\r\n8岁进入儿童剧团，开始艺能活动，曾演唱广告歌、童谣，为外国电影剧集配音，出演电视节目等。15岁时，被音乐制作人菅野洋子发掘，真正地开始了音乐活动。16岁在歌坛出道。\r\n坂本真绫在音乐以外的领域也具有丰富的才能，广泛活跃在舞台表演、电台主持、电视节目主持、执笔等领域，被称为“才女”，她是现在日本乐坛少数的实力派之一。\r\n\r\n2011年8月13日，在网志上正式宣布和声优铃村健一在2011年8月8日结婚。","career":["artist","seiyu"],"id":3877,"type":1,"locked":false},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/17/e1/78953_prsn_zH773.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/17/e1/78953_prsn_zH773.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/17/e1/78953_prsn_zH773.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/17/e1/78953_prsn_zH773.jpg"},"name":"連思宇","short_summary":"台湾女性配音员、广播节目助理主持人、漫画家、日文翻译员、声音导演。声音甜美可爱，是少女声代表之一。声线极广，主要属于高音类型，通常饰演少女或小女孩类型角色，也能诠释男孩角色。\r\n\r\n出道作品为迪士尼影集《天才学园》，担任主角之一──奥莉。","career":["mangaka","seiyu"],"id":78953,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":84},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/da/95/3002_crt_I1bP7.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/da/95/3002_crt_I1bP7.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/da/95/3002_crt_I1bP7.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/da/95/3002_crt_I1bP7.jpg"},"name":"バトー","summary":"公安9课成员，前陆上自卫队游骑兵部队成员。\r\n近乎通身义体化，比例仅次于草薙素子。\r\n佩戴于陆上自卫队时期特制的特殊义眼，带有传感器阵列、热传感器等。\r\n能熟练操控从小型到重型的各种武器。","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/36/df/79115_prsn_UR7Wu.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/36/df/79115_prsn_UR7Wu.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/36/df/79115_prsn_UR7Wu.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/36/df/79115_prsn_UR7Wu.jpg"},"name":"孟慶府","short_summary":"台湾男性配音员。\r\n\r\n华视配音训练班出身，与王贞令为同期的同学。","career":["seiyu"],"id":79115,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":3002},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/80/07/3006_crt_H9Mq3.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/80/07/3006_crt_H9Mq3.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/80/07/3006_crt_H9Mq3.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/80/07/3006_crt_H9Mq3.jpg"},"name":"荒巻大輔","summary":"内務省公安部所属。草薙たち部隊をスカウトし、自身が望む攻性の組織たる攻殻機動隊を設立する。権謀術数に長ける公安9課の司令塔。","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/c6/5c/78978_prsn_qzeaq.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/c6/5c/78978_prsn_qzeaq.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/c6/5c/78978_prsn_qzeaq.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/c6/5c/78978_prsn_qzeaq.jpg"},"name":"陳彥鈞","short_summary":"台湾男性配音员、舞台剧演员。中国文化大学戏剧系、国立臺北艺术大学剧场艺术研究所毕业。","career":["seiyu","actor"],"id":78978,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":3006},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/f5/c8/3008_crt_ftTsK.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/f5/c8/3008_crt_ftTsK.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/f5/c8/3008_crt_ftTsK.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/f5/c8/3008_crt_ftTsK.jpg"},"name":"公安9課","summary":"由前军官、法医科学家和警察侦探组成的信息安全和情报部门。\r\n组织结构以德国GSG-9特种部队为基础，与英国特种空勤团亦有交叉训练。\r\n是直属日本内务省，听命于总局长和日本首相的独立部队。\r\n有关第9课的大部分信息为高度机密，内务省不对其活动细节发表评论。\r\n公众并不知晓第9课的存在，国会和其他安全部队部门对9课的认识也仅为一个“黑色行动单位”。这使得9课能够独立运作，不受政府监督，以避免繁文缛节和官僚主义。\r\n9课负责众多独特职能，包括国家层面的信息安全、要员保护、调查贪污、打击恐怖组织乃至于暗杀，其形态的特殊也令其直面新型犯罪事件。","relation":"主角","actors":[],"type":4,"id":3008},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/12/a0/3010_crt_n4X10.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/12/a0/3010_crt_n4X10.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/12/a0/3010_crt_n4X10.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/12/a0/3010_crt_n4X10.jpg"},"name":"トグサ","summary":"元本庁の刑事で、草薙にスカウトされた新米隊員。電脳化しているが身体はほとんど生身で部隊唯一の妻帯者。リボルバーを愛用している。","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"","grid":"","large":"","medium":""},"name":"楊士賢","short_summary":"台湾男性配音员，师从李景唐。","career":["seiyu"],"id":79331,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":3010},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/aa/6b/3013_crt_N741A.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/aa/6b/3013_crt_N741A.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/aa/6b/3013_crt_N741A.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/aa/6b/3013_crt_N741A.jpg"},"name":"イシカワ","summary":"情報収集や分析、電脳工作に長けた古参隊員。技術屋らしくクールな性格で部隊を陰で支えるバイプレイヤー。","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/3c/75/79084_prsn_XxFRx.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/3c/75/79084_prsn_XxFRx.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/3c/75/79084_prsn_XxFRx.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/3c/75/79084_prsn_XxFRx.jpg"},"name":"何志威","short_summary":"台湾男性配音员。\r\n\r\n声线属于中偏高类型，常饰演青少年类型角色。","career":["seiyu"],"id":79084,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":3013},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/3f/b3/3018_crt_Wi21W.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/3f/b3/3018_crt_Wi21W.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/3f/b3/3018_crt_Wi21W.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/3f/b3/3018_crt_Wi21W.jpg"},"name":"サイトー","summary":"片目をアイパッチで覆う隊員。","relation":"配角","actors":[],"type":1,"id":3018},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/de/a6/3046_crt_Oph33.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cr